{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106365","id":2517514916,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6WDjqk","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106365","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106365.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106365.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106365","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106365/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106365/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106365/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9a631d1e45be92470310691122241af44334319c","number":106365,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"macOS: Send initial modifier keys as input events","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"A follow-on to #106317.\r\n\r\nEnsure modifier key events are pushed to the `Input` system when Godot is activated. This is important for actions that read modifier keys to alter their own behaviour. An example is clicking the zoom in / out buttons to force integer zoom:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d32d2e9b511dbdce4e79621a92c63088c9912ad0/editor/gui/editor_zoom_widget.cpp#L54\r\n\r\nAn example of this working, where Godot is not focused, but correctly handles the integer zoom:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5cdc7e42-118a-40cb-b6cf-cd9f40cae3e3\r\n\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n>\r\n> The mouse click event does have the correct modifier state, but Godot reads the keyboard pressed state, and therefore we push these special set of keys. A more reliable approach would be to raise two separate events, or allow the `pressed` event to optionally include the source event, ","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":